      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the biggest buyers of Cgi Federal in FY2026 to date?",
        "body": "The Department of State is the largest buyer of Cgi Federal with $235M in obligations. The General Services Administration obligated $181M and the Department of Justice obligated $139M. The Department of Veterans Affairs and the Department of Health and Human Services obligated $136M and $76M respectively."
